# Default owner for everything in the repo.
* @dcotelo

# The correctness- and security-critical packages. Called out separately so a
# change to either is visibly a different kind of review, and so a future
# co-maintainer inherits the distinction rather than having to learn it.
#
#   internal/sync       the owned-block tagging invariant: never create an
#                       untagged block, never delete or overwrite an event that
#                       is not provably ours, never propagate event content.
#   internal/googleauth OAuth token exchange and on-disk persistence.
/internal/sync/         @dcotelo
/internal/googleauth/   @dcotelo

# Anything that can change what ships to a user, or what runs with elevated
# permissions in CI.
/.github/workflows/     @dcotelo
/.goreleaser.yml        @dcotelo
/Dockerfile             @dcotelo
/deploy/                @dcotelo
